        147.14138793945312
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 25.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.4179077148438,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring, evaluation and review provide the means to assess the quality, effectiveness, coverage",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.394775390625,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "and delivery of collaborative TB/HIV activities. It promotes a learning culture within and across",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.429931640625,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "programmes and ensures continuous improvement of interventions. Evidence from operational",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.422119140625,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "research   has shown the importance of standardized monitoring and evaluation of  (130, 131)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4530639648438,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "collaborative TB/HIV activities to determine the impact of the activities and to ensure implementation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.392578125,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "and effective programme management. This section provides a brief overview of the monitoring and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.4310913085938,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "evaluation actions to support the implementation of collaborative TB/HIV activities. The section on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.3892211914062,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "HIV-associated TB within the accompanying operational handbook on TB and comorbidities provides",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4398803710938,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "further details, including a list of currently recommended core indicators to monitor collaborative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4404296875,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "TB/HIV activities  . These indicators are drawn from WHO’s guidance on TB surveillance ([ (7) WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.4154357910156,
        524.4135131835938,
        339.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Consolidated guidance on tuberculosis data generation and use. Module 1 – tuberculosis surveillance],",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.42578125,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "[WHO], in press [2023]) and from the WHO guidance on HIV strategic information  . Further  (132)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4559326171875,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "indicators can be found in  A guide to monitoring and evaluation for collaborative TB/HIV activities -",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        156.0498046875,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": ". 2015 revision (133)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4388427734375,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The monitoring and evaluation system for collaborative TB/HIV activities should be based on a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.4035034179688,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "strategy that includes clear goals, targets and guidelines for implementation of activities, as well",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.41796875,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "as specific indicators to measure progress. It should also include plans for data collection and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.4215698242188,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "management, analysis and dissemination, and use of results for programme improvement  .  (133)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.4201049804688,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Recording and reporting formats for HIV-associated TB should be standardized and aligned",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4244384765625,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "with existing monitoring and surveillance systems. Standardized indicators should be measured",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4387817382812,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "regularly, in both the private and public health sectors, to inform decision-making for programme",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4200439453125,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "implementation. Electronic health records and the use of unique identifiers can greatly enhance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        458.3249816894531,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "recording and reporting processes, facilitate analysis and minimize duplication  .  (132)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.394775390625,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The national TB/HIV coordination mechanism plays a vital role in coordinating monitoring and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.3927001953125,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "evaluation, as well as in convening stakeholders for regular review at all levels of the healthcare",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.3893432617188,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "system. The review process should include steps to (i) convene a body of stakeholders to review data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.415771484375,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "at specified intervals; (ii) develop simple, standard core analysis plans for routinely collected data;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4112548828125,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "(iii) adjust service delivery, supervision and resource allocation according to review findings and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4190063476562,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "conclusions; and (iv) track the effect of these adjustments by ongoing regular review. The frequency",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4542236328125,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "with which reviews are carried out will vary with level of the healthcare system; at facility level, reviews",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4365844726562,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "should be conducted at least monthly, while at national level, reviews may be conducted quarterly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        148.78269958496094,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "or annually  . (132)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        545.1672973632812,
        801.2599487304688,
        553.4072875976562,
        811.763916015625
      ],
